2 CONT
2 CONT The outstanding leader of the ancient Zhou people, the Xibo monarch,King Wen of ZhouGrandfather, the founder of the Zhou Dynasty.Zhou Wu Wang Ji FaestablishZhou Dynasty, posthumously named him "King Zhou".
2 CONT
2 CONT It is estimated that Gu Gong's father is the 15th grandson of Xuanyuan Yellow Emperor and the ancestor of ZhouHoujiThe 12th grandson, in the history of the development of the Zhou people, is a key figure in the great cause of Houj
