2 CONC ove from Feng to the foot of QishanZhou Yuan(now Qishanbei, Shaanxi), "the restoration of Houji, Gongliu's industry", the implementation of the agricultural development policy of "farming and weaving, the land is appropriate", to 
2 CONC achieve the situation of "the traveler has capital, the resident has livestock, and the people rely on its celebration", and the Zhou nationality gradually became stronger.
