2 CONT From: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emperor_Ku
2 CONT
2 CONT Kù (traditional Chinese: 嚳), or Dì Kù (traditional Chinese: 帝嚳), was a Emperor of China. He is the great grandson of the Yellow Emperor. According to speculative dates (from after 100 BC) he ruled from c. 2436 BC – c. 2366 BC. He 
2 CONC established schools and was the first emperor to practice polygamy.
