2 CONT Jiandi 簡狄, the mother of the Shang's first ancestor Xie 契 (daughter of a noble called Yousong 有娀 and second wife of Emperor Di Ku [Diku] 帝嚳), is said to have conceived when she ate a black egg that had dropped from the sky. Xie is
2 CONC  also thought to have been a descendant of the Yellow Emperor (Huang Di, Huangdi 黃帝). The black bird seemed to have been a kind of heraldic symbol or totem animal of the Shang people.
