1 CONT [edit] Literature
1 CONT He was the subject of a 64-chapter (in eight volumes) The Novel of the Prince of Qin of the Great Tang (?????? Datang Qin Wang Cihua) by Zhu Shenglin (???) of the Ming Dynasty. The novel is also known as The Biography of the Princ
1 CONC e of Qin of the Tang Dynasty (????? Tang Qin Wang Benzhuan), Romance of Tang (???? Tang Chuan Yanyi), and Romance of the Prince of Qin (???? Qin Wang Yanyi).
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit] Chinese popculture
1 CONT Hong Kong TVB made a TV drama about Li Shimin adventure based from the "Novel of the Prince of Qin of the Great Tang (??????)". TVB's 1983 martial arts drama "The Foundation" also featured a young Li Shimin prominently as one of i
1 CONC ts three leads (and later, villain). 
1 CONT In the epic novel Journey to the West, a fictional account of Li Shimin invention of the Door Gods is to protect him from a vengeful beheaded Dragon after failing to protect him. 
1 CONT
